    "description": {
      "value": "Made of shiny brown leather, this +1 striking sling has a single white thread interwoven into its cord.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Traits:** sonic\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou pull the white thread free, then whirl the sling in circles at high speed. It lets out an ear-piercing wave of sound.\n\nEach creature in a 30-foot cone takes 4d6 sonic damage (DC 21 basic Fortitude save). Any creature that fails is deafened for 1 round, or 1 hour on a critical failure."
    },
